<Paintings>
  <Text 60 40 16 #000000 0 "NeuralSphere-V1: one analog neuron (Stage A)">
  <Text 60 70 11 #000000 0 "4 pixel inputs + bias rail; each signed weight = conductance pair (RP to column cp, RN to column cn)\nOPP/OPN: transimpedance amplifiers hold cp, cn at virtual ground: v(tp) = -Rf*I+, v(tn) = -Rf*I-\nOPD: difference amplifier, S = v(tn) - v(tp) = Rf*(I+ - I-).  Expected S = -0.4393 V (Stage A hand calculation)">
  <Text 1080 590 11 #000000 0 "analog inference hardware: inputs -> S\nmeasurement interface: DC simulation / probe on S">
</Paintings>
